==Russian==

===Etymology===
{{af|ru|по-|-ня́ть}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|поня́ть}}
** {{audio|ru|Ru-понять.ogg}}
* {{IPA|ru|[paˈnʲætʲ]|a=Southern Russia}}
* {{IPA|ru|[paˈnʲat͡sʲ]|a=Belarus}} (''phonetic respelling'': поняць)
* {{IPA|ru|[pɐˈnʲatʲ]|a=Ukraine}}

===Verb===
{{ru-verb|поня́ть|pf|impf=понима́ть|vn=поня́тие}}

# to [[understand]], to [[comprehend]], to [[see]]
#: {{uxi|ru|'''По́нял'''|[[roger]], [[copy]], [[understood]]|q=radio}}
# to [[realize]], to [[appreciate]]

====Usage notes====
In the negative, this verb also has a colloquial usage with a present-tense (instead of future-tense) meaning: {{m|ru|[[я|Я]] [[не]] <b>пойму́</b>|t=I don't understand}}.

The form '''по́няла''' (as opposed to standard '''поняла́''') is sometimes heard colloquially.

====Conjugation====
{{ru-conj|pf|14b/c(1)+p|поня́ть|пойм}}
{{ru-conj|pf|14b/c(1)+p|поня́ть|пойм|old=1}}

====Related terms====
